# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We restate to be absolutely clear: we cannot invert the noise channel exactly; the inverse is not CPTP, nor is it a valid physical channel. However, we can effectively invert the channel as a linear combination of physical channels.\n"
msgstr "Pro úplnou jasnost zopakujme: šumový kanál nelze invertovat přesně; inverze není CPTP ani platný fyzikální kanál. Můžeme však kanál účinně invertovat jako lineární kombinaci fyzikálních kanálů.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the depolarizing channel:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{E} = (1 - p)\\mathcal{I}\n"
"+ \\frac{p}{3}(\\mathcal{X} + \\mathcal{Y} + \\mathcal{Z}),\n"
"$$\n"
"where: $\\mathcal{X}(\\rho) = X\\rho X$ etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pro depolarizační kanál:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{E} = (1 - p)\\mathcal{I}\n"
"+ \\frac{p}{3}(\\mathcal{X} + \\mathcal{Y} + \\mathcal{Z}),\n"
"$$\n"
"kde: $\\mathcal{X}(\\rho) = X\\rho X$ atd.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-23
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
